{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e11-scene-04",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "我昨天晚上太多活要干了  (I Had Too Much Work Last Night)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷",
    "xiaoye": "小叶",
    "kaiwen": "凯文"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Keeping her promise outside Xingtian, Bu Xiaogu gets dropped off in her admirer's flashy sports car while still wearing yesterday's outfit after working late—sparking instant office gossip from Xiaoye. Listen to Xiaogu, Xiaoye, and Kaiwen in Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你说这话肉不肉麻啊，恶不恶心？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "为什么抱你？你快点走吧！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "你可真厉害呀，你这么快就转正了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "转正？总编室给我转正了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "我是说你转正成许少爷女朋友了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "怎么可能，你能别瞎扯吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "全公司的人都知道了，昨天他接你下班，今天又来送你上班，你的衣服也没有换。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我拜托了，我昨天晚上太多活要干了，所以我没换衣服！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "你别骗人了，又没有人跟你抢。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "今儿真是撞邪了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "凯文哥早！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "小谷来了？快进去吧。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你说这话肉不肉麻啊，恶不恶心？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Don't you find talking to your car like that super cheesy and gross?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "为什么抱你？你快点走吧！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Why would I hug you? Hurry up and head home!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "你可真厉害呀，你这么快就转正了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You really are amazing — made official in no time at all!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "转正？总编室给我转正了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Made official? Did the chief editor's office make me permanent?!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "我是说你转正成许少爷女朋友了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I mean you officially became that rich young heir's girlfriend!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "怎么可能，你能别瞎扯吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'How could that be true — can you stop making up nonsense?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "全公司的人都知道了，昨天他接你下班，今天又来送你上班，你的衣服也没有换。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The whole company knows! He picked you up yesterday, drove you in today, and you haven't even changed clothes.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我拜托了，我昨天晚上太多活要干了，所以我没换衣服！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Give me a break — I had way too much work to finish last night, so I didn't change!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "你别骗人了，又没有人跟你抢。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Stop trying to fool me; nobody here is competing with you for him.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "今儿真是撞邪了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Today has honestly gone completely sideways.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "凯文哥早！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Morning, Kaiwen!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "小谷来了？快进去吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You're here, Xiaogu? Head right on in.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
